{"title":"广州印发2024年优化营商环境工作要点","date":"2024-05-17","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">营商环境<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">是高质量发展的&ldquo;生命线&rdquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:36.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;background:#F5F9FF\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:36.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;background:#F5F9FF\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:36.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;background:#F5F9FF\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:\r\n1.5pt\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;\r\nletter-spacing:1.5pt\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span>日，</span><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#48ABE8;\r\nletter-spacing:1.5pt\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">《广州市<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年优化营商环境工作要点》</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:1.5pt\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: var(--weui-BRAND); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">（下称《工作要点》）正式公布。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36.05pt; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#48ABE8;\r\nletter-spacing:1.5pt\">《工作要点》共四个方面、涵盖<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>项改革任务</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">，加快营造产业友好型、企业友好型、企业家友好型营商环境，全力建设全国产业生态最好、政务服务最优、综合成本最低的营商环境高地。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#3F3F3F;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">《工作要点》作为广州新一轮营商环境改革的&ldquo;任务书&rdquo;，主要面向广大市场主体，并附有责任分工清单，旨在通过年度目标任务化、任务项目化、项目清单化，为各类企业享受营商环境政策红利提供更有力指引。</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; background: rgb(245, 249, 255); outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202405/1(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 607px; height: 2800px;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202405/2(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 607px; height: 2800px;\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202405/3(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 607px; height: 2800px;\" /></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}